OL,3,GNEWSAExcitement as first section of
OL,4,Across-border bridge arrives by barge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first main section of a bridge
OL,7,Flinking Northern Ireland and the
OL,8,FRepublic of Ireland has arrived by
OL,9,Fbarge.
OL,11,FThe bridge, which will link County Down
OL,12,Fin Northern Ireland with County Louth
OL,13,Fin the Republic of Ireland, is being
OL,14,Ffunded by the Irish Government's shared
OL,15,Fisland fund and is due to open in early
OL,16,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
