OL,3,GNEWSAExcitement as first section of
OL,4,Across-border bridge arrives by barge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough ground works have been ongoing
OL,7,Fat the Narrow Water site in Warrenpoint
OL,8,Ffor two years, a major progress point
OL,9,Fhappened on Tuesday with the arrival of
OL,10,Fone of two huge metal towers that will
OL,11,Fdefine the opening bridge's appearance.
OL,13,FA further arrival is expected in the
OL,14,Fcoming days.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
